    "id": "ACT-GRAM",
    "revision": 5,
    "title": "Use a clear reference point",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk3-places-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Use a clear reference point",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "A direction such as 北边 is relative to the place named before it. 中间 places something between the two reference points joined with 和.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "学校在朋友家北边。",
                "pinyin": "xuéxiào zài péngyou jiā běi biān 。",
                "meaning": "The school is north of my friend’s home.",
                "audio": "1807e0782dfaca19277a16f5120fd52baaa048e915dc1f6db59aff515777cb1b"
              },
              {
                "text": "学校在银行和医院中间。",
                "pinyin": "xuéxiào zài yínháng hé yīyuàn zhōngjiān 。",
                "meaning": "The school is between the bank and the hospital.",
                "audio": "fc7805723e5a9b2c5cc200db310d6667641be9ef9cbf697b636a2af7acebb46d"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
